      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8c5322f7",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: put_an_end_to_domestic_abuse; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in a suit leaning over a woman who is sitting on the floor, appearing distressed and covering her face. The text overlay reads 'put an end to domestic abuse!'. The scene is designed to evoke empathy and awareness about domestic abuse. The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to influence public opinion and action by visually representing the suffering caused by domestic abuse and calling for societal intervention. The image uses emotional appeal to motivate viewers to support or take action against domestic abuse. There is no toxicity present in the form of hate, abuse, cyberbullying, or harmful stereotypes; the message is focused on raising awareness and promoting a social cause.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6215ae78"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
