      "description": "A scene depicting a man in a suit leaning over a woman who is sitting on the floor, appearing distressed and covering her face. The spatial arrangement shows the man dominating the space above the woman, suggesting an act of abuse. The scene is framed to evoke empathy and awareness about domestic abuse, with the text overlay reinforcing the message.",
