      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "empowerment",
      "label": "Empowerment",
      "description": "The process of becoming stronger and more confident, especially in terms of social, political, or economic rights. The meme implicitly calls for the empowerment of victims of domestic abuse by encouraging societal intervention and support, which is a core goal of anti-domestic abuse movements.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
