      "instance_name": "victim_support",
      "label": "Victim Support",
      "description": "The provision of assistance, resources, and advocacy to individuals who have experienced abuse or trauma. The meme’s message implicitly relies on the concept of victim support, suggesting that societal action can help victims recover and prevent future abuse.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
