      "instance_name": "societal_intervention",
      "label": "Societal Intervention",
      "description": "The involvement of society, institutions, or the government in addressing and resolving social problems. The meme calls for societal intervention to end domestic abuse, implying that individual action alone is insufficient and systemic change is necessary.",
